Keep a shared height as 0.
Keep a shared width as 0.
Keep a shared budget as 0.
Keep a shared startrow as 0.
Keep a shared startcolumn as 0.
Keep a shared modulus as 0.
Keep a shared cells as 0.
Keep a shared counts as an empty list of whole numbers.
Keep a shared next as an empty list of whole numbers.
Keep a shared escapes as 0.
Set height to 2.
Set width to 2.
Set budget to 2.
Set startrow to 0.
Set startcolumn to 0.
Set modulus to 1000000007.
Set cells to height times width.
For every cell from 0 to cells minus 1.
Place 0 into counts.
Place 0 into next.

The start is startrow times width plus startcolumn.
Set item start of counts to 1.

To wipe from spot (a whole number).
If spot is at least cells, return.
Set item spot of next to 0.
Wipe from spot plus 1.

To spill from spot (a whole number).
The row is spot divided by width.
The column is spot modulo width.
The weight is item spot of counts.
If row is 0, set escapes to escapes plus weight.
If row is 0, set escapes to escapes modulo modulus.
If row is more than 0, set item (spot minus width) of next to item (spot minus width) of next plus weight.
If row is height minus 1, set escapes to escapes plus weight.
If row is height minus 1, set escapes to escapes modulo modulus.
If row is less than height minus 1, set item (spot plus width) of next to item (spot plus width) of next plus weight.
If column is 0, set escapes to escapes plus weight.
If column is 0, set escapes to escapes modulo modulus.
If column is more than 0, set item (spot minus 1) of next to item (spot minus 1) of next plus weight.
If column is width minus 1, set escapes to escapes plus weight.
If column is width minus 1, set escapes to escapes modulo modulus.
If column is less than width minus 1, set item (spot plus 1) of next to item (spot plus 1) of next plus weight.

To sweep from spot (a whole number).
If spot is at least cells, return.
If item spot of counts is more than 0, spill from spot.
Sweep from spot plus 1.

To save from spot (a whole number).
If spot is at least cells, return.
Set item spot of counts to item spot of next.
Save from spot plus 1.

To travel from move (a whole number).
If move is more than budget, return.
Wipe from 0.
Sweep from 0.
Save from 0.
Travel from move plus 1.

Travel from 1.
Show escapes.
